(7647638, 1243344, 138630, '<td valign="top">IMO the choice of border background was unfortunate as it makes words difficult to read.  Merry Christmas becomes, for example, ny and then the bottom of Christmas which in any other season might also be unreadable.  Highlights are blown.  But I heartily approve the sentiment.</td>', 'IMO the choice of border background was unfortunate as it makes words difficult to read.  Merry Christmas becomes, for example, ny and then the bottom of Christmas which in any other season might also be unreadable.  Highlights are blown.  But I heartily approve the sentiment.', '2019-12-01 21:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
